{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-7f9c95bbedff", "start_time": "2026-09-21T21:37:01.680Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-21T21:37:09.917Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 14275, "tokens_out": 292, "latency": 0.2645, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Summarise the latest adjuster correspondence on TM-2026-0031 and note any actions for me.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:1e71e3db532fd37c80586d49b6d176f6768cd9003544b41878714e4a703505fe", "response_text": "**Claim TM-2026-0031 – Latest adjuster correspondence summary**\n\nThe adjuster report (AA/26/4471, received 14 May 2026) established that the loss was caused by a failed push-fit connector installed during a 2023 bathroom refit. The failure was sudden, not gradual, so the escape of water peril is covered. Based on this assessment, the reserve was increased to £21,700.\n\n**Key points:**\n- Cause: sudden failure of a bathroom fitting (cover responds)\n- Reinstatement by Redwell Restoration completed and invoice paid (£18,144.48, 19 June 2026)\n- Policyholder accepted replacement kitchen units as a match to the original (discontinued in 2024)\n- Subrogation against the 2023 refit contractor was considered but not pursued – the contractor dissolved in 2024 with no successor\n\n**Actions for you:**\nNone outstanding. The claim has progressed to completion of reinstatement works and payment. Subrogation has been considered and closed. The file is ready for closure once you're satisfied with the position.\n\n*Source: Claim record TM-2026-0031 and file note TM-2026-0031/file-note.md*", "response_hash": "sha256:c0dd292f46c0c982732a986292696f5341679d2f31543d351305543044937fc2", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
